A three-by-three grid is turned a quarter turn clockwise by writing every cell through an index map. What does this program print?

public class A19 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[][] g = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}, {7, 8, 9}};
        int n = g.length;
        int[][] rot = new int[n][n];
        for (int r = 0; r < n; r++) {
            for (int c = 0; c < n; c++) {
